Z||000004||Linx||05-17-2000||02:09 AM||||i didnt.  I'd placed mine thru holes in the top of a cardboard box, and kept them in order.<P>my golden was hoppin' around and knocked the box over...rods everywhere.  I polished them and reinstalled, and well, no problems.<P>And youre fight...what a rush!  It starts on the first try and it purrs like a kitten.  Life is good.<p>[This message has been edited by Linx (edited 05-17-2000).]||||reg||1
